# libFuzzer writes its own corpus here as it discovers inputs. Those are
# machine-generated and regenerable, so only the hand-built seeds are tracked.
#
# `!*/` is required. An excluded directory blocks every negation inside it, so
# a seed in a new harness directory would otherwise be silently un-addable.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!query/seed
!*/*.seed
